{"type":"message","id":"9a6d81b6","parentId":"a42fbc43","timestamp":"2026-03-10T13:18:45.102Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:e1b719dc-47fb-45f7-b4b2-c36742813ce6 vault-sync] Sync the Obsidian vault: 1) cd ~/obsidian-vault && git add -A 2) If there are changes, commit with message including current timestamp (format: \"Vault auto-save $(date +'%Y-%m-%d %H:%M')\") 3) git push to https://github.com/TeraHertz2000/tera-vault. Report only if there were changes and the push succeeded.\nCurrent time: Tuesday, March 10th, 2026 — 1:18 PM (UTC) / 2026-03-10 13:18 UTC\n\nReturn your summary as plain text; it will be delivered automatically. If the task explicitly calls for messaging a specific external recipient, note who/where it should go instead of sending it yourself."}],"timestamp":1773148725078}}
